        "content": "<p>Firestar99 opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14023\">PR #14023</a> from <code>Firestar99:convert_partial</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When isle uses an implicit <code>convert</code> from A to B and the conversion declaration is <code>partial</code>,<br>\nit emits:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nb\">Option</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">a_to_b</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">arg0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kp\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nc\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This fails to compile since you can't <code>?</code> a <code>&amp;Option&lt;T&gt;</code>, only on an <code>Option</code> itself.<br>\nSo add a <code>.as_ref()</code> to convert it to <code>Option&lt;&amp;T&gt;</code> before <code>?</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
